<title>BELGIUM: EU beef labelling talks continue.</title>
<headline>EU beef labelling talks continue.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's special committee on agriculture committee will continue discussions next week on a Commission proposal for beef labelling and cattle identification schemes, EU officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Two working groups are drafting new texts but it looks unlikely that agreement will be reached at the Farm Council on February 17-18, said one official.</p>
<p>A Commission official added that the committee has yet to resolve technical issues such as tagging and whether the scheme should be voluntary.</p>
</text>
